    <Member Name="EStopOK" Datatype="Bool" Remanence="NonRetain" Accessibility="Public"><Comment><MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">Raw E-STOP status: 1 = released (C01)</MultiLanguageText></Comment></Member>
