    <Member Name="FlareTrip" Datatype="Bool" Remanence="NonRetain" Accessibility="Public"><Comment><MultiLanguageText Lang="en-US">Flare trip (PSH, E-STOP, power-up): flare open until RESET</MultiLanguageText></Comment></Member>
